318
00:25:11,540 --> 00:25:16,540
飽きず 報われるなんて 考えず無邪気に
playing innocently without thinking of rewards or getting bored.

319
00:25:16,540 --> 00:25:21,640
結局 ただ笑えたなら それでよかった
In the end, if we could just smile, that was enough.

320
00:25:22,040 --> 00:25:26,040
ずっと 察せない 鈍感さ拾ったら
Picking up an oblivious insensitivity we could never quite grasp,

321
00:25:26,040 --> 00:25:31,540
つなぐくらい しちゃうくらい はしゃいでしまおう
let's get so carried away we might even hold hands.

322
00:25:41,940 --> 00:25:46,340
たまに見かける進化を追って
Chasing the evolution we occasionally see,

323
00:25:46,340 --> 00:25:51,340
急ぎ転べば尻尾挟む
rushing in, we trip and get our tails caught.

324
00:25:51,340 --> 00:25:59,140
委ねられないラインを 無我夢中で越えて前へ
Crossing lines we can't entrust to anyone, rushing ahead in a trance,

325
00:25:59,140 --> 00:26:05,040
理想への招待状 頂戴
give me the invitation to our ideal!

326
00:26:05,040 --> 00:26:09,040
一生 あぁ楽しもうよシーソー
A lifetime—ah, let's enjoy this seesaw,

327
00:26:09,040 --> 00:26:16,040
壊すほど目一杯 戸惑って居場所を探した
struggling with all our might until it breaks, searching for our place.

328
00:26:16,640 --> 00:26:21,040
落ちた傷は日常なんてさ
The scars we've fallen into are just everyday life,

329
00:26:21,040 --> 00:26:26,540
後悔のないよう 最後まで生き急ごう
so let's live in a rush till the very end with no regrets.

330
00:26:26,540 --> 00:26:33,540
やりたいこと成して 楽しい 手を振ってらしくいたい 苦しいなんて嫌だ
Achieving what we want, happily waving, wanting to be true to ourselves—suffering is the worst.

331
00:26:33,540 --> 00:26:45,540
真っすぐなり振り構わず 網羅したい 我儘な夢もっと謳歌しよう
Straight ahead, without caring about appearances, we want to encompass all our selfish dreams even more!

332
00:26:53,040 --> 00:26:58,340
はいということで、怒涛のゲストコーナーからその曲でしたが
So, that was the song from the whirlwind guest corner!

333
00:26:58,740 --> 00:27:02,040
みんな何の曲ってなってたね！
Everyone was wondering what song that was!

334
00:27:02,540 --> 00:27:07,340
実はこの曲はこよからのサプライズプレゼントです！
Actually, this song is a surprise present from me!

335
00:27:07,540 --> 00:27:13,040
今の曲はなんと4曲目のオリジナル曲なんですよ！いぇーい！
That song was actually my 4th original song! Yay!

336
00:27:14,040 --> 00:27:24,040
昨日のお誕生日カウントダウン配信で3曲目のオリジナル曲も発表しているので
Since I announced my 3rd original song in yesterday's birthday countdown stream,

337
00:27:24,540 --> 00:27:33,540
まさかもう一曲あるとは思っていなかったんじゃないですかー？
you probably didn't think there'd be yet another song, right?

338
00:27:33,740 --> 00:27:42,340
実はこの曲は、渡辺翔さんに作っていただきました！
Actually, this song was written by Sho Watanabe!

339
00:27:43,040 --> 00:27:58,340
この曲「エゴスティック・シーソー」はライブのすぐ後にMVがプレミア公開されます！
The MV for "Egoistic Seesaw" will premiere right after this live!

340
00:27:58,540 --> 00:28:04,540
概要欄にもURLを追加しますのでぜひチェックしてくださいね！
I'll add the URL in the description box, so please check it out!

341
00:28:05,540 --> 00:28:15,540
このあとはまだまだ怒涛のライブコーナーです！2つ目のゲストパートもあります！
After this, we still have the whirlwind live corner and a second guest part!

342
00:28:16,540 --> 00:28:23,540
それではステージを移動します！いくよー！
Now, let's move the stage! Here we go!

343
00:28:35,540 --> 00:28:39,040
時を刻む唄 作詞・作曲：麻枝准
[Song: Toki o Kizamu Uta / Lyrics & Music: Jun Maeda]

344
00:28:50,040 --> 00:28:54,540
落ちていく砂時計ばかり見てるよ
I just watch as the hourglass continues to fall.

345
00:28:54,540 --> 00:29:01,040
さかさまにすればほらまた始まるよ
When I turn it upside down, look, it starts over.

346
00:29:01,040 --> 00:29:05,540
刻んだだけ進む時間に
In this time that ticks away as it passes,

347
00:29:05,540 --> 00:29:12,040
いつか僕も入れるかな
I wonder if I'll ever be able to enter too.

348
00:29:12,040 --> 00:29:23,540
きみだけが過ぎ去った坂の途中は あたたかな日だまりがいくつもできてた
On the slope where only you passed by, many warm sunny spots had formed.

349
00:29:23,540 --> 00:29:28,540
僕ひとりがここで優しい
Here, I alone am gentle,

350
00:29:28,540 --> 00:29:35,540
温かさを思い返してる
recalling that warmth.

351
00:29:35,540 --> 00:29:43,540
きみだけを きみだけを好きでいたよ
You alone, you alone, I loved you.

352
00:29:44,040 --> 00:29:58,540
風で目が滲んで遠くなるよ
My eyes blur with the wind and grow distant.

353
00:29:58,540 --> 00:30:01,040
遠くなるよ
Growing distant...

354
00:30:02,160 --> 00:30:04,280
遠くなるよ
It's getting distant...

355
00:30:05,100 --> 00:30:07,540
いつまでも 覚えてる
Forever and ever, I'll remember

356
00:30:07,540 --> 00:30:09,600
なにもかもが変わっても
Even if everything changes,

357
00:30:09,800 --> 00:30:13,800
ひとつだけ ありふれたものだけど
just one thing, though it's mundane,

358
00:30:14,280 --> 00:30:18,660
見せてやる 輝びに満ちたそのひとつだけ
I'll show you that one radiant thing.

359
00:30:18,660 --> 00:30:22,820
いつまでも いつまでも 守ってゆく
Forever and ever, I will protect it.

360
00:30:34,580 --> 00:30:39,340
肌寒い日が続く もう春なのに
Chilly days continue, even though it's spring,

361
00:30:39,740 --> 00:30:45,560
目覚まし時計より早く起きた朝
waking up earlier than the alarm clock.

362
00:30:46,100 --> 00:30:52,020
三人分の朝ご飯を作るきみが
You, making breakfast for three people,

363
00:30:52,020 --> 00:30:58,400
そこに立っている
are standing right there.

364
00:30:59,040 --> 00:31:05,848
きみだけが きみだけが
Only you, only you

365
00:31:05,848 --> 00:31:11,460
そばにいないよ
aren't by my side.

366
00:31:12,360 --> 00:31:19,800
昨日まで すぐそばで 僕をみてたよ
Until yesterday, right beside me, you were looking at me.

367
00:31:41,660 --> 00:31:54,848
きみだけを 好きでいたよ
It's only you that I loved.

368
00:31:56,560 --> 00:32:09,520
きみだけと 歌う唄だよ
It's the song I sing only with you.

369
00:32:10,420 --> 00:32:23,740
僕たちの 刻んだ時だよ
It's the time we carved together.

370
00:32:24,060 --> 00:32:32,440
片方だけ続くなんて 僕はいやだよ
Continuing to be just one-sided... I hate that.

371
00:32:33,260 --> 00:32:38,600
いつまでも 覚えている
I'll always remember.

372
00:32:47,360 --> 00:32:56,180
いつまでも 覚えてる この町が変わっても
I'll always remember, even if this town changes,

373
00:32:56,180 --> 00:33:00,580
どれだけの悲しみと出会うことになっても
no matter how much sorrow I meet.

374
00:33:00,580 --> 00:33:06,080
さあ行くよ 歩き出す 坂の道を
Come on, let's go, walking up the hill road.

375
00:33:47,160 --> 00:33:52,020
謳歌、いつもの様に 過ぎる日々にあくびが出る
Ah, like every day, passing days make me yawn.

376
00:33:52,360 --> 00:33:56,660
ざんざめく夜、越え、今日も
Crossing the noisy night, today too,

377
00:33:57,020 --> 00:34:00,880
渋谷の街に朝が降る
morning falls upon the streets of Shibuya.

378
00:34:01,260 --> 00:34:07,020
どこか虚しいような そんな気持ち つまらないな
Somehow empty feelings, how boring...

379
00:34:07,020 --> 00:34:10,648
でもそれでいい そんなもんさ
but that's fine, that's just how it is.

380
00:34:12,348 --> 00:34:18,740
知らず知らず隠してた 本当の声を響かせてよ
Unknowingly hiding it, let your true voice resonate,

381
00:34:18,740 --> 00:34:24,300
ほら見ないふりしていても 確実にそこにある
hey, even if you pretend not to see it, it's there.

382
00:34:25,600 --> 00:34:32,180
感じたままに描く 自分でもらったその色で
Drawing as I felt, with the color I chose myself,

383
00:34:32,720 --> 00:34:39,200
眠い空気纏う朝に 訪れた青い世界
in a morning in drowsy air, a blue world arrived.

384
00:34:39,740 --> 00:34:45,548
好きなものを好きだと言う 怖くて仕方ないけど
Saying I like what I like, though terrified,

385
00:34:45,548 --> 00:34:49,848
本当の自分に出会えた気がしたんだ
I felt like I met my true self.

386
00:35:02,156 --> 00:35:03,506
鳴呼、手を伸ばせば
Ah, if I reach out my hand,

387
00:35:03,806 --> 00:35:06,806
伸ばすほどに 遠くへゆく
the further I reach, the further away it gets.

388
00:35:08,106 --> 00:35:11,306
思うようにいかない、今日も
Things don't go the way I want, even today,

389
00:35:11,806 --> 00:35:14,806
また慌ただしくもがいてる
struggling in a flurry once again.

390
00:35:15,306 --> 00:35:18,106
悔しい気持ちもただ
These frustrating feelings

391
00:35:18,106 --> 00:35:21,506
情けなくて 涙が出る
are just pathetic, and tears fall.

392
00:35:21,906 --> 00:35:24,606
踏み込むほど 苦しくなる
The deeper I step, the more painful it gets,

393
00:35:24,606 --> 00:35:26,656
痛くもなる
and the more it hurts too.

394
00:35:29,606 --> 00:35:32,606
感じたままに進む
Moving forward just as I felt,

395
00:35:32,906 --> 00:35:36,006
自分で選んだこの道を
on this path I chose myself.

396
00:35:36,406 --> 00:35:39,606
重いまぶた擦る夜に
In a night rubbing heavy eyelids,

397
00:35:39,906 --> 00:35:42,906
しがみついた青い誓い
a blue oath I clung to.

398
00:35:43,106 --> 00:35:46,906
好きなことを続けること
Continuing to do what I love

399
00:35:47,306 --> 00:35:50,206
それは「楽しい」だけじゃない
isn't just "fun".

400
00:35:50,206 --> 00:35:53,806
本当にできる？ 不安になるけど
Can I really do it? Though I get anxious,

401
00:35:54,606 --> 00:35:57,906
何枚でも ほら何枚でも 自信がないから
no matter how many times, see, since I lack confidence,

402
00:35:57,906 --> 00:36:00,906
描いてきたんだよ
I've been drawing all along.

403
00:36:01,106 --> 00:36:07,906
何回でも ほら何回でも 積み上げてきたことが武器になる
No matter how many times, what I've piled up becomes a weapon.

404
00:36:08,506 --> 00:36:14,906
周りを見ったって 誰と比べたって 僕にしかできないことはなんだ
Looking around, comparing with anyone, what is the thing only I can do?

405
00:36:15,406 --> 00:36:19,206
今でも自信なんかない それでも
Even now I have no confidence, even so,

406
00:36:21,506 --> 00:36:26,906
感じたことない気持ち 知らずにいた想い
feelings I've never felt, thoughts I was unaware of,

407
00:36:27,506 --> 00:36:34,606
あの日踏み出して 初めて感じたこの痛みも全部
all this pain I felt for the first time stepping out that day.

408
00:36:35,006 --> 00:36:38,606
好きなものと向き合うことで
By facing what I love,

409
00:36:38,906 --> 00:36:42,606
触れたまだ小さな光
a small light I touched—

410
00:36:42,606 --> 00:36:46,606
大丈夫、行こう あとは楽しむだけだ
it's okay, let's go, all that's left is to enjoy it.

411
00:36:49,106 --> 00:36:52,206
全てを賭けて描く
Drawing with everything on the line,

412
00:36:52,506 --> 00:36:55,906
自分にしか出せない色で
with colors only I can bring out.

413
00:36:56,106 --> 00:37:02,806
朝も夜も走り続け 見つけ出した青い光
Running through morning and night, the blue light I found.

414
00:37:03,206 --> 00:37:06,806
好きなものと向き合うこと
Facing what I love,

415
00:37:07,006 --> 00:37:15,706
今だって怖いことだけど もう今はあの日の透明な僕じゃない
even now it's scary, but now I'm no longer the transparent me of that day.

416
00:37:18,006 --> 00:37:21,606
ありのままのかけがえのない僕だ
I am my irreplaceable, true self.

417
00:37:22,506 --> 00:37:27,906
知らず知らず隠してた本当の声を響かせてよ
Let the true voice I unconsciously hid echo out.

418
00:37:28,206 --> 00:37:35,606
ほら 見ないふりしていても 確かにそこにあるよ
Look, even if you pretend not to see it, it's definitely right there.

419
00:37:36,506 --> 00:37:41,906
知らず知らず隠してた本当の声を響かせてよ
Let the true voice I unconsciously hid echo out.

420
00:37:42,206 --> 00:37:49,906
さあ 見ないふりしていても 確かにあるよ 君の中に
Come on, even if you pretend not to see it, it's definitely inside you.

421
00:38:29,306 --> 00:38:34,506
風に吹かれて 誰も気づかぬよう
Blown by the wind, so that no one notices,

422
00:38:35,006 --> 00:38:39,506
区別がつかない モノクロの世界
a monochrome world where distinction can't be made.

423
00:38:40,006 --> 00:38:46,406
色を足しても 何も見えなくて
Even adding color, nothing could be seen,

424
00:38:46,606 --> 00:38:52,156
まるで私は 息を止めていた
it was as if I had stopped breathing.

425
00:38:57,406 --> 00:39:03,506
もういいよ 遠くても 叶えたい 私は
That's enough, even if it's far, I want to make it come true.

426
00:39:04,006 --> 00:39:09,906
こんな世界 想いも 抱きしめていたいのについに
Even though I wanted to embrace my feelings in this world,

427
00:39:10,106 --> 00:39:20,606
夢のキャンバスに 居続ける意味は この胸に 輝いている ストーリー
the meaning of staying on the dream's canvas is shining in my heart, a story.

428
00:39:33,906 --> 00:39:39,506
与えることに 意味などないけど
Though there's no meaning in giving,

429
00:39:39,806 --> 00:39:45,006
拾い集めた カケラ失うの？
will I lose the fragments I picked up?

430
00:39:45,506 --> 00:39:55,506
そして夜は その冷たさを 溶かして 手を伸ばした
And the night melted that coldness and reached out a hand.

431
00:39:56,156 --> 00:40:02,156
もういいよ 遠くても 届けたい 私は
That's enough, even if it's far, I want to reach it.

432
00:40:02,684 --> 00:40:04,274
受け止めてく
Catching them,

433
00:40:04,274 --> 00:40:05,784
涙も
even my tears—

434
00:40:05,784 --> 00:40:08,344
抱きしめていたいのにな
I wanted to hold them close...

435
00:40:08,644 --> 00:40:11,584
夢のキャンバスに
On the canvas of my dreams,

436
00:40:11,584 --> 00:40:14,304
心込めるのは
pouring my heart into it—

437
00:40:14,844 --> 00:40:19,324
この空に 描きだしてく
painting it across this sky,

438
00:40:19,644 --> 00:40:24,664
ストーリー
a story...

439
00:40:32,804 --> 00:40:39,844
そして 夜はその冷たさを 溶かして
And then, melting the chill of the night,

440
00:40:39,844 --> 00:40:42,864
手を伸ばした
I reached out my hand.

441
00:40:43,464 --> 00:40:46,144
もういいの 遠くても
It's alright, even if it's far,

442
00:40:46,144 --> 00:40:49,324
叶いたい 私の
I want to make my dream come true—

443
00:40:49,624 --> 00:40:55,004
こんな世界 想いも言葉で包んだ
wrapping this world and my feelings in words.

444
00:40:55,764 --> 00:41:02,344
夢のキャンバスに 色を足してゆく
Adding colors to the canvas of my dreams,

445
00:41:02,544 --> 00:41:06,864
この胸に 今輝いて
shining brightly within my heart right now.

446
00:41:07,444 --> 00:41:10,284
強くなくてもいい
It's okay not to be strong,

447
00:41:10,564 --> 00:41:13,204
壊れかけてもいい
it's okay to start falling apart.

448
00:41:13,564 --> 00:41:18,784
この心は 永遠に羽ばたいて
May this heart soar forever,

449
00:41:19,404 --> 00:41:23,804
響くように 塗り替えていく
repainting the world to resonate—

450
00:41:24,284 --> 00:41:29,884
Ｐａｌｅｔｔｅ
Palette.

451
00:41:52,564 --> 00:41:56,264
ドッキリ大成功☆
Prank successfully pulled off!

452
00:42:28,764 --> 00:42:32,284
悪戯に君をずっと見ていた訳じゃない
It's not like I've just been playfully watching you all this time.

453
00:42:32,284 --> 00:42:35,304
僕の考えを当ててごらんよ
Try guessing what's on my mind!

454
00:42:35,664 --> 00:42:38,604
些細な仕草 視線 瞬き
Subtle gestures, gazes, blinking—

455
00:42:38,604 --> 00:42:42,384
君はもう掌に
you're already in the palm of my hand.

456
00:42:43,224 --> 00:42:46,744
剥き出しのtrapなんてかかる訳ないわ
There's no way I'd fall for some bare trap.

457
00:42:46,744 --> 00:42:49,844
甘い言葉にも惑わされない
Nor will I be swayed by sweet words.

458
00:42:50,384 --> 00:42:56,944
心の奥の奥の奥まで見透しちゃうよ
I'll see right through to the very depths of your heart!

459
00:42:59,004 --> 00:43:01,164
Looking thinking touching feeling

460
00:43:01,164 --> 00:43:02,444
Why you know?

461
00:43:02,444 --> 00:43:04,624
Looking thinking touching feeling

462
00:43:04,624 --> 00:43:06,004
I know it

463
00:43:06,004 --> 00:43:08,204
Looking thinking touching feeling

464
00:43:08,204 --> 00:43:09,444
Understand?

465
00:43:09,444 --> 00:43:11,764
Meaning meaning of love Are you ready?

466
00:43:12,744 --> 00:43:16,704
自覚ないでしょうね 思い通りに
You probably don't even realize you're being

467
00:43:16,704 --> 00:43:19,944
君は動かされている事！
manipulated just as planned!

468
00:43:20,204 --> 00:43:23,364
単純じゃないの 駆け引きのhintを
Don't overlook all the hints

469
00:43:23,364 --> 00:43:26,164
全て見落とさないで
in our complex game of push-and-pull.

470
00:43:26,544 --> 00:43:29,024
加速してく 二人の鼓動
Our accelerating heartbeats...

471
00:43:29,024 --> 00:43:31,804
心理戦は次のstageへ
This mind game moves to the next stage.

472
00:43:43,464 --> 00:43:49,824
虚ろなその目に 私はどう映るの
How do I reflect in those hollow eyes of yours?

473
00:43:50,064 --> 00:43:57,144
とても煌びやかで まるでシンデレラ
So dazzling, just like Cinderella.

474
00:43:57,764 --> 00:44:05,264
突き刺す視線 ゾクと感じて 君に余裕見せつけて
Feeling your piercing gaze, showing you my composure,

475
00:44:05,504 --> 00:44:12,684
あからさま過ぎて お腹がよじるよ 既に君はもう出来上がってる
it's so blatant it makes my stomach hurt—you're already completely wrapped around my finger!

476
00:44:13,464 --> 00:44:15,804
Looking thinking touching feeling

477
00:44:15,804 --> 00:44:17,084
Why you know?

478
00:44:17,084 --> 00:44:19,284
Looking thinking touching feeling

479
00:44:19,284 --> 00:44:20,524
I know it

480
00:44:20,524 --> 00:44:22,764
Looking thinking touching feeling

481
00:44:22,764 --> 00:44:24,024
Understand?

482
00:44:24,024 --> 00:44:26,864
Meaning meaning of love Are you ready?

483
00:44:27,924 --> 00:44:31,444
唯一無二のjoker 手にするために
To get my hands on the one and only joker,

484
00:44:31,784 --> 00:44:35,704
